          "message": {
            "text": "This upgrade intentionally changes only the kerfjs dependency and lock resolution. The published 4.4.0 tarball adds the opt-in kerfjs/router subpath; every implementation and declaration file Domotion currently imports, plus both vendored AI bundle checksums, is byte-identical to 4.3.0. The package manager also proposed removing platform libc selectors from 26 unrelated optional dependencies, so those changes were excluded from the lockfile.",
            "markdown": "This upgrade intentionally changes only the kerfjs dependency and lock resolution. The published 4.4.0 tarball adds the opt-in kerfjs/router subpath; every implementation and declaration file Domotion currently imports, plus both vendored AI bundle checksums, is byte-identical to 4.3.0. The package manager also proposed removing platform libc selectors from 26 unrelated optional dependencies, so those changes were excluded from the lockfile."
          },
